{"4785890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eldread: Horrors of a Dark Moon", "steam_appid": 4785890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5087030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent on a lunar expedition to investigate a silent colony, your crew crashes on its surface. Guided only by the unsettling rumors of a discovered bio log, you are completely unprepared for the unspeakable horrors lurking beneath the surface of Eldread.<i><strong> </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/03237042dc7ab583e27ec3ef9104d8e3.poster.avif?t=1787566274\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/03237042dc7ab583e27ec3ef9104d8e3.webm?t=1787566274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/03237042dc7ab583e27ec3ef9104d8e3.mp4?t=1787566274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now stranded, you must scavenge resources to repair your ship and uncover the dark fate of the colony that came before you. Explore a hostile world and survive deadly hazards, all while managing your dwindling oxygen levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/b77753be5ea74b10831589729fd79c24.avif?t=1787566274\" width=1280 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle strange mutants and cosmic horrors with weapons you scavenge or purchase with limited cash. You can also  harness the power of cosmic entities through a mysterious, mutagen  called Corruption. But beware: the corruption will eventually consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/ebe66675e9a5b4325c8ed5c87fc96671.avif?t=1787566274\" width=1283 height=726 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In my recent update, one of the new features is a conversation system where you can talk to your allies and gain special items or equipments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/cf54e88f3870db2f1dce1d15f3ad86ae.avif?t=1787566274\" width=1247 height=699 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game will feature:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-At least 10 playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-21 expeditions(different levels) within 7 regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-60+ enemy types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-100+ different events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-100+ items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-randomize end game boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-randomize mutation ability set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent on a lunar expedition to investigate a silent colony, your crew crashes on its surface. Guided only by the unsettling rumors of a discovered bio log, you are completely unprepared for the unspeakable horrors lurking beneath the surface of Eldread.<i><strong> </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras/03237042dc7ab583e27ec3ef9104d8e3.poster.avif?t=1787566274\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785890/extras